  "core_concepts": [
    {
      "explanation": "训练选择参数 θ，使样本损失之和最小：θ*=argmin_θ Σ_i L(f_θ(x⁽ⁱ⁾),y⁽ⁱ⁾)。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 5
          }
        }
      ],
      "id": "cc1",
      "term": "经验风险最小化",
      "claim_type": "explanation"
    },
    {
      "explanation": "第 k 步沿负梯度更新 θ：θ^(k+1)=θ^k−η∇_θJ(θ^k)。学习率 η 决定局部步长。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 8
          }
        }
      ],
      "id": "cc2",
      "term": "梯度下降",
      "claim_type": "explanation"
    },
    {
      "explanation": "讲义把历史方向 m^t 加入更新：θ^(t+1)=θ^t−η∇f(θ^t)−αm^t，以平滑方向并加速一致方向。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 10
          }
        }
      ],
      "id": "cc3",
      "term": "动量",
      "claim_type": "explanation"
    },
    {
      "explanation": "狭长曲率会导致振荡，鞍点附近梯度小但并非极小值；深层复合还会造成梯度消失或爆炸。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 12
          }
        },
        {
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 16
          }
        },
        {
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 19
          }
        }
      ],
      "id": "cc4",
      "term": "训练地形困难",
      "claim_type": "explanation"
    },
    {
      "explanation": "归一化与残差连接改善信号传播；梯度裁剪限制梯度范数；ReLU 为 max(0,z)，其正区间导数不衰减。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 20
          }
        },
        {
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 22
          }
        },
        {
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 24
          }
        }
      ],
      "id": "cc5",
      "term": "稳定化手段",
      "claim_type": "explanation"
    },
    {
      "explanation": "标量对向量的梯度写成行向量；向量输出关于向量输入的 Jacobian 为“输出维×输入维”。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 32
          }
        }
      ],
      "id": "cc6",
      "term": "Jacobian 约定",
      "claim_type": "explanation"
    },
    {
      "explanation": "若 x→u→z，则 dz/dx=(dz/du)(du/dx)，维度为 (m×p)(p×n)=m×n。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 34
          }
        }
      ],
      "id": "cc7",
      "term": "矩阵链式法则",
      "claim_type": "explanation"
    },
    {
      "explanation": "计算图把共享的链式乘积只计算一次，再把上游梯度传给多个局部导数。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 36
          }
        }
      ],
      "id": "cc8",
      "term": "反向传播的复用",
      "claim_type": "explanation"
    },
    {
      "explanation": "对层 x_out=f(x_in,θ)，先求局部 Jacobian L^x、L^θ，再计算 g_in=g_out L^x 与 dJ/dθ=g_out L^θ。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 38
          }
        },
        {
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 41
          }
        }
      ],
      "id": "cc9",
      "term": "层的反向接口",
      "claim_type": "explanation"
    },
    {
      "explanation": "训练迭代先前向保存中间量，再反向累积梯度，最后使用优化器更新参数。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 42
          }
        }
      ],
      "id": "cc10",
      "term": "前向—反向—更新",
      "claim_type": "explanation"
    },
    {
      "explanation": "批损失是样本损失的平均，相应参数梯度也是逐样本梯度的平均。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 45
          }
        }
      ],
      "id": "cc11",
      "term": "批处理梯度",
      "claim_type": "explanation"
    },
    {
      "explanation": "若 x_out=W x_in，则输入梯度为 g_in=g_out W；权重梯度由上游梯度与输入形成外积。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 46
          }
        },
        {
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 48
          }
        }
      ],
      "id": "cc12",
      "term": "线性层梯度",
      "claim_type": "explanation"
    },
    {
      "explanation": "一个节点流向多支时，回传贡献相加；同一参数在多处使用时，其各处参数梯度也相加。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 53
          }
        },
        {
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 55
          }
        }
      ],
      "id": "cc13",
      "term": "分支与参数共享",
      "claim_type": "explanation"
    },
    {
      "explanation": "只要目标是标量，反向传播可计算它对计算图中任意节点或边变量的梯度，而不局限于模型参数。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 61
          }
        }
      ],
      "id": "cc14",
      "term": "可微编程",
      "claim_type": "explanation"
    },
    {
      "explanation": "可固定模型并求 argmax_x(y_j+λR(x))，再按输入梯度做上升；正则项约束所求输入。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 66
          }
        }
      ],
      "id": "cc15",
      "term": "输入优化",
      "claim_type": "explanation"
    }
  ],
  "glossary": [
    {
      "term": "上游梯度",
      "definition": "损失关于当前层输出的导数 g_out。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 41
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "term": "局部 Jacobian",
      "definition": "当前运算输出关于该运算输入或参数的导数矩阵。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 38
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "term": "梯度裁剪",
      "definition": "当梯度范数过大时按阈值缩放梯度。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 22
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "term": "参数共享",
      "definition": "计算图的多个位置引用同一参数，反向时贡献需累加。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 55
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "common_misconceptions": [
    {
      "misconception": "梯度接近零就一定到了局部最小值。",
      "correction": "鞍点也可能具有零梯度，需要结合曲率或邻域行为判断。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 16
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "misconception": "分支反向时任选一条路径即可。",
      "correction": "同一变量经多条路径影响损失时，各路径梯度贡献必须求和。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 53
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "misconception": "共享参数的梯度只算一次使用位置。",
      "correction": "每个使用位置都产生贡献，最终对同一参数累加。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source_id": "mit-6.7960-f24-lecture-02-slides",
          "anchor": {
            "type": "page",
            "value": 55
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "misconception": "讲义数值例题中的正号更新与通常梯度下降矛盾。",
      "correction": "例题把学习率写成 η=−0.2，因此“加 η 倍梯度”与沿负梯度方向更新一致；必须连同符号约定阅读。",
      "citations": [
